{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>והיה</b> [And it shall come to pass]: יטפו — they will drip, as in the mashal of oil from a flint of rock." "<b>וכל אפיקי</b> [and all the channels of]: strong places, and they are not many."], :book :joel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {0 "The phrase 'oil from a flint of rock' alludes to Deuteronomy 32:13; rendered literally as Ibn Ezra's metaphorical illustration."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Joel -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/yoel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:06:49.178932571Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}